  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h1>Athena</h1>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/r/I80VLV.svg?compress=false\" alt=\"由 Terrarium 製作\" width=\"155\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstitch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/r/dCVaUA.svg?compress=false\" alt=\"未安裝 Indium 時無法與 Sodium 相容\" width=\"234\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<h2>📖關於 📖</h2>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>\n<p>Athena 是一款多功能、跨平台的烘焙模型載入器，內建支援相連紋理。它為每種類型採用獨立的烘焙模型，以確保在各平台上的最佳效能與相容性。Athena&nbsp;的相連紋理方法（CTM）專為這些模型設計，旨在減少不必要的運算並解決常見問題。此外，Athena 支援自訂檢查機制，例如針對玻璃板進行的特殊垂直剔除功能，進一步提升其實用性。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.terrarium.earth%252fstitch\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/documentation/gitbook_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitBook\" height=\"56\"> </a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fterrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<h2>✨社群✨</h2>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutube.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/terrariumearth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitch-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitch\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftwitter.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitter-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkofi.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"贊助 Ko-fi\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTerrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/terrariumearth/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"> 本模組的圖標使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flucide.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucide Icons</a> 製作 <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>",
